{"title": "Perfect Sentry", "pageid": 12940, "url": "https://bg3.wiki/wiki/Perfect_Sentry", "categories": ["Passive features"], "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\">\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box bg3wiki-tooltip-gradient-common\">\n<figure class=\"mw-default-size mw-halign-right\" typeof=\"mw:File/Frameless\"><a href=\"/wiki/File:Generic_Threat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-description\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp/300px-Generic_Threat.webp, /w/images/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp 1.5x\"><img src=\"/w/images/thumb/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp/300px-Generic_Threat.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"300\" height=\"300\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/4/4f/Generic_Threat.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a><figcaption></figcaption></figure>\n<p><b>Perfect Sentry</b> is a passive feature that makes it impossible to be <a href=\"/wiki/Surprised_(Condition)\" title=\"Surprised (Condition)\">surprised</a>.\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Description\"> Description </span></h2>\n<p>You can't be <span class=\"bg3wiki-icontext-icon nowrap\"><span class=\"mw-default-size bg3wiki-icon\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><a href=\"/wiki/Surprised_(Condition)\" title=\"Surprised (Condition)\"><picture><source srcset=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/38px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp 1.5x, /w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/50px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp 2x\"><img alt=\"Surprised\" src=\"/w/images/thumb/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp/25px-Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp\" decoding=\"async\" width=\"25\" height=\"25\" class=\"mw-file-element\"></picture></a><a href=\"/w/images/2/2c/Surprised_Condition_Icon.webp\" class=\"mw-file-source\" title=\"View source image\"><!-- Image link for Crawlers --></a></span></span> <a href=\"/wiki/Surprised_(Condition)\" title=\"Surprised (Condition)\">Surprised</a>. \n</p>\n<div style=\"clear: both;\"></div>\n</div> \n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"How_to_learn\"> How to learn </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">\n<p>Used by creatures:</p><ul style=\"list-style-type: none\"><li>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Hellfire_Watcher\" title=\"Hellfire Watcher\">Hellfire Watcher</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Oliver\" title=\"Oliver\">Oliver</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Orin\" title=\"Orin\">Orin</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Ptaris\" title=\"Ptaris\">Ptaris</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Sarevok_Anchev\" title=\"Sarevok Anchev\">Sarevok Anchev</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Shadow-Cursed_Needle_Blight\" title=\"Shadow-Cursed Needle Blight\">Shadow-Cursed Needle Blight</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_(creature)\" title=\"Steel Watcher (creature)\">Steel Watcher (creature)</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Steel_Watcher_Titan\" title=\"Steel Watcher Titan\">Steel Watcher Titan</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/Therezzyn\" title=\"Therezzyn\">Therezzyn</a>,  <a href=\"/wiki/W%27wargaz\" title=\"W'wargaz\">W'wargaz</a></li></ul>\n</div>    <div class=\"bg3wiki-preview-only\">\n\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"Brief_preview\"> Brief preview </span></h2>\n<div class=\"bg3wiki-tooltip-box\">Cannot be <a href=\"/wiki/Surprised\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"Surprised\">surprised</a>.</div>\n</div>\n<!-- \nNewPP limit report\nCached time: 20260714200214\nCache expiry: 86400\nReduced expiry: false\nComplications: [no‐toc]\nCPU time usage: 0.033 seconds\nReal time usage: 0.038 seconds\nPreprocessor visited node count: 716/1000000\nPost‐expand include size: 3591/4194304 bytes\nTemplate argument size: 1738/4194304 bytes\nHighest expansion depth: 20/200\nExpensive parser function count: 0/750\nUnstrip recursion depth: 0/20\nUnstrip post‐expand size: 814/5000000 bytes\nExtLoops count: 40/1000\nLua time usage: 0.003/7.000 seconds\nLua memory usage: 643708/52428800 bytes\n-->\n<!--\nTransclusion expan